%% WarpTalk Module 1 - Translation Room Management
%% Recommended Audio Routing State Diagram
%% Converted from PDF to Mermaid

---
title: Recommended Audio Routing State Diagram
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING: START
    PENDING --> READY: config ready
    READY --> BROADCASTING: session starts

    BROADCASTING --> PAUSED: room pause
    PAUSED --> BROADCASTING: room resume

    BROADCASTING --> SPEECH_DELAYED: stt latency high
    SPEECH_DELAYED --> BROADCASTING: stt recovered

    BROADCASTING --> TRANSLATION_DELAYED: translation latency high
    TRANSLATION_DELAYED --> BROADCASTING: translation recovered

    BROADCASTING --> VOICE_DELAYED: tts latency high
    VOICE_DELAYED --> BROADCASTING: tts recovered

    BROADCASTING --> STANDARD_VOICE: voice clone unavailable
    STANDARD_VOICE --> BROADCASTING: voice clone recovered

    BROADCASTING --> CAPTION_ONLY: audio unavailable
    VOICE_DELAYED --> CAPTION_ONLY: tts unavailable
    STANDARD_VOICE --> CAPTION_ONLY: tts unavailable
    CAPTION_ONLY --> BROADCASTING: audio recovered

    BROADCASTING --> ENDING: session ends or system disables
    PAUSED --> ENDING: session ends or system disables
    SPEECH_DELAYED --> ENDING: session ends or system disables
    TRANSLATION_DELAYED --> ENDING: session ends or system disables
    VOICE_DELAYED --> ENDING: session ends or system disables
    STANDARD_VOICE --> ENDING: session ends or system disables
    CAPTION_ONLY --> ENDING: session ends or system disables

    ENDING --> SAVING_OUTPUTS: flush runtime
    SAVING_OUTPUTS --> COMPLETED: outputs linked
    COMPLETED --> [*]: END
